WEBVTT

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:09.360
<i>That's Doubashi of Hakone Academy High School.</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.610
<i>He's huge.</i>

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.750
<i>But that's not all.</i>

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.570
<i>The mysterious aura 
overflowing from his body...</i>

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:17.990
<i>M-My leg...</i>

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.350
<i>Why am I sweating so much?</i>

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.580
There's two guys coming from behind!

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.830
Two guys from Sohoku High School 
caught up at the very end!

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.800
You idiot! Didn't you watch last year's race?

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:29.380
What?

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.580
Sohoku High School always cuts it close!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.010
We caught up to the front!

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:56.160
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:07.500
We caught up.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.330
I see a Hakone Academy High School jersey.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:12.290
<i>Road Monster Doubashi</i>

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:11.870
Including him, there's seven 
guys in the lead pack.

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:12.710
It's eight.

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:13.660
What?

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:16.940
But there's one, two, three...

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.870
I subtracted the number we passed 
from the number that rode ahead.

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:19.910
That's amazing!

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:22.180
Sohoku High School caught up to the front!

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:25.330
There's only four kilometers 
left to the first result line!

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.290
Hey, it's you.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:30.540
That jersey, that number tag...

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.630
You're that guy from
Hakone Academy High School!

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.970
You wanna fight, huh?

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.300
<i>Doubashi...</i>

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:46.060
<i>This is Doubashi, the Monster of the Road?</i>

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.600
<i>He's certainly different from the 
other riders I've fought against.</i>

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:55.070
<i>He's as intimidating as a large, wild beast.</i>

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:58.430
<i>His oppressive air makes me feel 
like I couldn't beat him in a fight.</i>

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.490
<i>That pressure flows from his entire body.</i>

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:03.990
<i>His confidence is creating that.</i>

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:06.270
<i>He's a second-year.</i>

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:07.980
<i>He bears the scars of countless falls.</i>

00:03:08.650 --> 00:03:10.500
<i>Why wasn't he in this race last year?</i>

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:14.000
<i>This battle will come down to a split-second.</i>

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:18.760
<i>Do you feel that pressure, too, Kaburagi?</i>

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.890
You're that pig from
Hakone Academy High School!

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.050
What are you doing here, pig?

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:25.920
<i>He doesn't feel it?</i>

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:26.930
<i>Did he just call him a pig?</i>

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:30.280
You're the orange from this morning.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:31.850
You're a sprinter, huh?

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.260
I'm not a sprinter.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:37.230
I'm just here because of a mistake.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.990
You're wearing tag #15.

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:43.040
That means you're 15th on the 
Hakone Academy High School lineup.

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.280
I can't believe you're here 
when you're just a sub.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:51.010
<i>Did no one tell him how 
to read the number tags?</i>

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:53.670
<b>Team
 Number</b>

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:53.670
<b>Individual
Number</b>

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:53.670
<i>We're wearing the single-digit ones!</i>

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:57.090
I bet you're an unbelievable idiot.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.540
I'm not an idiot!

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.320
If anything, I'm...

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:01.970
That's right! A genius!

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:03.590
Kaburagi!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:08.600
Fine. Riding's the best 
way to shut an idiot up.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.730
<i>He's moving.</i>

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:11.350
<i>His pressure just skyrocketed.</i>

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.310
I was just getting bored with taking it easy.

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.300
Crap, Doubashi's going to increase his pace!

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.540
After him!

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.390
Senpai, I can't.

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:22.570
My legs are too weak to move.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:29.870
Wow, look at him accelerate!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.040
<i>We didn't make it in time.</i>

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.590
<i>We left at the same time, too.</i>

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.930
<i>But before I knew it,
he was five meters ahead.</i>

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:43.550
<i>While I was getting in position, 
he got ten meters ahead.</i>

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:47.140
<i>I knew it was coming,
but I couldn't react in time.</i>

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:50.140
<i>Three kilometers until the first result line.</i>

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.600
<i>This is the end.</i>

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:56.000
Is it time yet?

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.440
Are you ready? How much longer?

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:00.180
I'm ready to pull.

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.740
Isn't that our strategy to catch up?

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.090
I heard what they said.

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:06.320
Sohoku High School always 
cuts it close, right?

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:10.390
<i>He's an unbelievable idiot.</i>

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:12.810
You think we can catch up?

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:18.380
Well, with the way that pig accelerated, 
even an all-rounder like me could catch up!

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:27.590
I'm catching glimpses of him.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:29.730
We're keeping up in acceleration.

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:31.100
We'll gradually catch up to him.

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:33.100
But there's two and a half kilometers left.

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:37.110
We don't have time to take it slow!

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:44.030
<i>His pressure increased when he 
grasped his lower handlebars.</i>

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:47.980
Here we go. Don't fall behind.

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.320
Did you notice?

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:53.240
I just grabbed my lower handlebars 
for the first time this race.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.960
I'd been holding my uppers this whole time.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:02.090
I thought it'd be cool to have 
a sealed move in reserve.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:04.070
<i>He's leaning so far forward.</i>

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:06.430
<i>But his reason seems so stupid.</i>

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.430
<i>Cool? Sealed move?</i>

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.680
I was hoping to hold onto it until 
just before the finish line, though.

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:15.090
<i>And he wanted to know if I noticed?</i>

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:19.150
<i>Kaburagi, I've been watching from behind, 
and while we were passing the others,</i>

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:21.740
<i>you were holding your lower handlebars.</i>

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.110
<i>Did you not notice?</i>

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.570
<i>It doesn't matter.</i>

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.690
Lower handlebar released!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.320
<i>Advance, Kaburagi!</i>

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.270
<i>Such incredible acceleration.</i>

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.580
<i>I'm right behind, but I feel 
like I'm going to fall behind.</i>

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:44.690
<i>He must've been practicing on his 
own for the Inter-High since then.</i>

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:47.330
You're not going home yet?

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:50.680
Oh, no. Well, actually...

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:55.230
The vending machine below the school
is the only one with the soda I like.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.880
I'm going to go get some.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.860
One minute, twenty-one seconds!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:08.700
The straight behind the reservoir.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:11.860
Damn it. I can't break 1:20.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:16.980
Maybe I'm rising too far up when I'm dancing,
 but sometimes my rear tire slips.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:19.720
Maybe I'm putting too much load on the front.

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:21.880
Maybe I'm using too much power too early.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.260
One more time.

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:34.250
Don't lose speed now! Pedal!

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:35.870
One minute, twenty seconds!

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.630
I'm so close!

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:41.440
I was so close. Damn it.

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:47.440
<b>Move your load back 10%.
Then you'll break 20.</b>

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.900
<i>Crap!</i>

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:52.150
One minute, eighteen seconds!

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:56.020
I broke nineteen seconds in just a few days.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:58.870
Ten percent...

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:03.870
I didn't think I could manage 
something so precise, but I did it.

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:08.180
Who left this note?

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.150
Was it the god of bicycles?

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:11.510
No.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:16.260
It was the god of Orange Beena,
since I always buy that!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:20.180
Are you stupid, showoff?

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:22.530
You're expending too much 
energy when you pull.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:23.870
You'll exhaust yourself.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:26.940
You can reduce your power by 20%, showoff.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.470
What? Twenty percent?

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:30.990
Don't you mean one or 100?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.320
I can't manage something that precise.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.330
Imaizumi-san, you do it.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:39.600
This is 80, and this is 60.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:42.230
I can't tell the difference at all.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:43.850
That's because you're stupid.

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:44.960
I'm not stupid.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:46.740
You're clearly stupid.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:48.710
<i>Is he...</i>

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:47.870
What?

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:52.720
<b>Break 1:20
at 20% less
 than full power.</b>

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.720
God left me something again!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:56.710
I see. God has orders for me this time.

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:59.430
Okay, I'll try it!

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:01.680
Eighty percent, eighty percent...

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:05.100
<b>Segments</b>

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:05.100
<b>Orange</b>

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:05.100
Eight pieces of a ten-segmented orange.

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:09.110
One minute, twenty-one seconds! So close!

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:12.210
"Your knees are too wide 
when you're dancing."

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:13.090
I see.

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:16.360
"You can make better use of your 
arm muscles if you stay under 90."

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.610
Really?

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:23.450
<i>He won't listen to people, 
but he will listen to notes.</i>

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:28.710
<i>Use your scapula well?</i>

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.580
<i>Huh, this god knows everything.</i>

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:33.210
What?

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.620
Aoyagi-san...

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.860
Are you...

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.430
Aoyagi-san, are you training in secret, too?

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:44.440
I just got some amazing information.

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.230
What?

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:48.040
You use the muscles around your scapula to...

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:53.090
Wait, Aoyagi-san. Don't buy any 
Orange Beena from this vending machine.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.690
I'm going to buy them.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.700
R-Really?

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:00.490
<i>He's amazing, in his own way.</i>

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:05.080
Aoyagi-san, do you believe in God?

00:10:05.940 --> 00:10:07.830
Where did that come from?

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:14.710
During middle school,
Danchiku and I joined Team SS.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.640
They were tough and strict.

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:19.970
They had a lot of rules, too.

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:24.720
But I wanted to get stronger,
so I grit my teeth and kept riding.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.410
I was always frustrated.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:29.690
They told me not to smile, except when I won.

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.190
I thought I was riding to win.

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:36.530
I worked hard, but I didn't 
really see results.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.530
It's strange, though.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:42.280
Since I started high school 
and joined this team...

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:45.570
Imaizumi-san is too logical and sarcastic.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:48.270
Naruko-san is overbearing and annoying.

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:52.170
And Onoda-san, who I thought 
I admired, is unreliable.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.130
But I'm having so much fun.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:57.780
What do you suppose this feeling is?

00:10:57.780 --> 00:11:02.950
Chasing after the pig in front of us is 
really tough and takes everything I have,

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:04.890
but I'm having a lot of fun.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:09.770
I feel like I've gotten stronger 
since joining this team.

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:14.520
Watching Koga-san, Sugimoto-san, 
Teshima-san, and everyone else ride

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:18.090
has made something well up inside me.

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:20.170
I feel like they're pushing me forward.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:25.510
Oh, but not so much you, Aoyagi-san.

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:26.840
You don't really push.

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:27.660
Hey.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.600
Quit complaining.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.580
Do you think we can catch up?

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:33.730
I honestly have a feeling we can.

00:11:33.730 --> 00:11:36.500
I've been conserving my energy.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:41.590
And this is the first time I've told anyone,
but I have God on my side.

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:44.600
The god of Orange Beena!

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:45.850
You're right.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:50.140
<i>Your stupidity, your unyielding spirit...</i>

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:52.090
<i>Your desire to show off.</i>

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:56.650
<i>They're all things a sprinter needs, Kaburagi!</i>

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:09.160
That idiot is catching up?

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.910
I'm here, pig!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.690
Right at the end!

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.250
Make fools of them, Doubashi.

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:19.930
<i>They should be approaching 
the first result line soon.</i>

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:23.760
<i>The two from Sohoku High 
School should be catching up.</i>

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.480
<i>If they do, show them.</i>

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:30.240
<i>Overwhelm them with your true strength.</i>

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:33.150
<i>I doubt I have to tell 
you to do that, though, abs.</i>

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:36.660
<i>Not if you're the Monster 
of Hakone Doubashi that I,</i>

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:40.530
<i>Izumida Touichirou, know so well.</i>

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:46.110
<i>When he breaks the zipper on his jersey, 
that's when they'll tremble with fear.</i>

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.080
<i>Isn't that right, Doubashi?</i>

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.040
Either way, I'll win.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:58.040
After all, I'm right!

00:12:58.460 --> 00:13:00.490
Why do I have to assist?

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.590
I've told you a bunch of times already.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.510
It's because you're a first-year 
and Hamauchi's a third-year.

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:07.640
I'm faster than him.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.890
Speed wins. That's how racing works.

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:11.410
Control yourself.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:14.020
Hamauchi's a third-year. It's his last race.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:17.480
You know what your job is, Doubashi.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.150
Why did you hit him?

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.980
Why would a first-year 
hit third-year Hamauchi?

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:25.870
I controlled myself. I did as I was told.

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:29.090
I controlled myself and launched 
Hamauchi-san before the finish line.

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:30.650
I put him in the perfect position.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:31.490
But then...

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:33.640
Damn it. I pulled you here.

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.000
Go, Hamauchi-san.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:36.830
Go, hurry!

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:40.530
You idiot, you pulled too fast.

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:42.870
It took everything I had to keep up.

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:47.510
I don't have the strength left to sprint.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.780
Can you believe he said that?

00:13:49.780 --> 00:13:51.730
He ended up placing twenty-first.

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:55.770
So I asked him what he spent the 
last three years doing and hit him.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.650
<b>Club Resignation Form</b>

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.650
Write your name on this by tomorrow!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.110
You're out of the club.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:05.820
Captain Fukutomi asked me to manage the 
club while he was focusing on the race.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:09.200
Everyone expected great things from you.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:12.380
They said an amazing 
first-year joined the club.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:15.500
But you can't control your emotions.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.990
I control myself plenty.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.420
It's not enough!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.630
The club can't keep you any longer!

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:24.740
You missed this year's 
Inter-High member selection

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:28.510
because you hit second-years 
Takayama and Shirakawa!

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:34.510
They were afraid of my ability, so they 
reduced the air pressure in my tires.

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:36.300
That's why I hit them.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.680
I don't regret it.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.100
I'm right!

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:43.710
Your way is wrong for being part of a team.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:47.610
Doubashi, quit the bicycle club.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.870
<b>Hakone Academy High School Bicycle Racing Club</b>

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:52.700
<b>Club Application Form</b>

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:57.750
I'm first-year Doubashi Masakiyo,
and I'm joining the bicycle club today.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.160
I have experience.

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.130
He joined again.

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:05.380
I'll never quit riding.

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:10.860
Can he seriously rejoin the club?

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:13.680
There's no rule against it.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.490
<i>You can't be serious.</i>

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:21.850
<i>I'll never quit this over 
your stupid reasons!</i>

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:26.020
What? Why do I have to clean up again today?

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:28.280
I did it yesterday, Azuma-san.

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.940
Now, now. This is part of your training.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:33.580
They're always telling 
you to control yourself.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:35.920
And we're second-years.

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:38.440
You should fix the way you talk to us.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:39.540
Shut up!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:43.100
You may be a second-year, 
but you've never beaten me.

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:44.250
Quit acting so self-important!

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:47.640
Just do it, okay?

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:49.460
Control yourself, Doubashi. Later.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:51.730
Shut up! Wait!

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:54.970
Damn it.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:59.160
I rode really hard today at practice.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:01.100
My thighs hurt.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.750
They were slacking off.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:09.660
I hate guys who talk like that when they 
don't even take practice seriously.

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:10.860
Damn it.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:14.660
You missed the Inter-High member selection.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.510
I don't regret it!

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:18.120
I'm right!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:24.250
<i>I missed the Inter-High member selection.</i>

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.750
<b>Group</b>

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.750
<b>Izumida</b>

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.750
<b>Group</b>

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.750
<b>Manami</b>

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:32.880
<i>I said I didn't regret it, but I 
wanted to ride in the Inter-High.</i>

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:39.600
<i>If I rode, I guess I'd be taking either 
Izumida-san or Shinkai-san's position.</i>

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:37.030
<b>Group</b>

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:37.030
<b>Izumida</b>

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:39.600
<b>Group</b>

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:39.600
<b>Shinkai</b>

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:45.120
<i>Crap. They train a lot and are crazy strong.</i>

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:47.110
<i>That's a tough hurdle to clear.</i>

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.850
<i>I need to get stronger.</i>

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:54.670
<i>Maybe I do need to control myself better.</i>

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:57.360
I just can't help it.

00:16:57.360 --> 00:17:00.910
It's because I don't think I'm wrong, but...

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:03.370
Okay, I'll start controlling myself tomorrow.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:06.250
Doubashi did it again!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.000
Again?

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.090
He started it!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.880
Stop, Doubashi! Stop!

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:14.010
I just told him to move because he was 
blocking me with his crappy riding!

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:12.490
Stop!

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.740
You're out of the club! That's enough!

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.680
<b>Club Application Form</b>

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.680
Class

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.680
<b>Doubashi Masakiyo</b>

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.680
<b>Bicycle Racing Club</b>

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.680
<b>Hakone Academy High School</b>

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:25.350
He's gotten quieter lately.

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:29.100
It's already his third 
time joining the club.

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:31.540
I heard they made him sign 
an agreement that he'd

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:33.350
quit the club forever the 
next time he hit someone.

00:17:33.350 --> 00:17:34.610
Seriously?

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:38.990
His performance has quieted 
down a lot, too.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.510
Doubashi, we need to talk.

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:48.560
What? Yes, sir.

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.840
Why don't we go for a ride?

00:17:52.220 --> 00:17:55.380
What's wrong? You've been 
quiet lately, Doubashi.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:58.310
Well...

00:17:58.310 --> 00:17:59.720
Your performance is declining, too.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.820
They kept telling me performance 
wasn't everything,

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:05.730
so I did my best and tried to control myself.

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:08.470
You've quit the Hakone Academy High School 
bicycle club more times than anyone else,

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:10.110
Doubashi Masakiyo.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:18.150
I talked Fukutomi-san into
letting me handle your future...

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:21.200
...as another sprinter.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:24.160
Wait! Wait, Izumida-san.

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:26.490
I want to keep riding.

00:18:26.490 --> 00:18:29.330
I want to keep riding at 
Hakone Academy High School.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:33.750
I have to control myself, right?
I know I have to.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:36.160
What are you talking about, abs?

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:37.260
What I meant, abs...

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:39.550
Abs?

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:43.320
You're blessed with a
great build and explosive power.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:48.560
Telling you to control yourself is the 
same as not polishing the spear you have.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.730
Not many sprinters hold true spears.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:54.880
You should stand out.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:58.990
Bare your overflowing emotions.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:02.190
Don't you want to see how far they can reach?

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:06.420
Not reason. Not words.

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:07.830
Your inner self.

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:09.740
Your irrepressible emotions.

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:11.580
That's strength.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:14.140
Why wouldn't you use them?

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:16.510
Why keep your spear sheathed?

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.020
<i>Strength...</i>

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:22.230
There's no need for control. Release.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:25.880
Control your emotions with concentration.

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:28.220
Focus only during races.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:33.060
Then the noise of your surroundings 
won't bother you anymore.

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.900
<i>Noise...</i>

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.390
Come, abs! Follow me!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:38.900
Pedal to your heart's content!

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:43.240
Show me the abomination inside you, abs!

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:44.950
Abs, abs!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.950
<i>Izumida-san's fast!</i>

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:49.370
Abs, abs, abs, abs!

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:52.670
He's pulling away. Crap.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:55.500
<i>Interesting. Emotion is strength.</i>

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.990
<i>You say I can do it, Izumida-san?
Then I'll do it.</i>

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:03.760
<i>I'll put the man inside me on full display!</i>

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:07.800
I'll crush you!

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:08.810
Abs!

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:15.400
I won't let anyone stand in front of me.

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.560
I'm right!

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:19.400
I'll win! I am Hakone Academy High School!

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:21.900
It's been decided since the beginning.

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:25.690
There's only one truth, and that's winning!

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:30.950
Irrepressible emotion! That's strength!

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:37.380
What was that? That was different 
from his other shouts.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.960
He's like a wild animal.

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:41.950
He's up to something, Aoyagi-san!

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:44.300
Let's catch up to him before 
he accelerates again!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:46.580
Hey, Hakone Academy High School pig!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:50.770
This is the strength of Sohoku 
High School that you mocked!

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.900
The pursuing Sohoku High School duo...

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.900
They caught up to Hakone Academy High School!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:01.030
The rest is up to you, sprinter Aoyagi-san!

00:21:01.680 --> 00:21:02.960
I'm counting on you!

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:05.950
<i>One kilometer left.</i>

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:09.920
<i>I took my time getting ready 
behind Kaburagi this time.</i>

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:10.910
<i>I won't lose.</i>

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:12.660
<i>It's mine!</i>

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:15.230
Supersonic Oxygen Bullet!

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:17.830
Sohoku High School made a 
comeback at the last second!

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.210
He did it!

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.250
Sohoku High School's riding alone!

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:21.650
He's fast!

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:22.720
He's so round!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:23.830
What do you think, pig?

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:26.380
This is the eleventh hour 
power of Sohoku High School.

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:35.160
<i>What was that?</i>

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:38.150
<i>An unfortunate word just 
crossed my mind for a second.</i>

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:43.650
The hunt doesn't start until 
my prey's in front of me.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.320
<i>He let us pass him.</i>

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:46.780
Aoyagi-san!

00:23:23.570 --> 00:23:26.960
Abs, abs, abs, abs.

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:33.040
Abs.

00:23:33.990 --> 00:23:34.550
Abs.

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:36.350
Abs!

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:40.020
<i>NEXT RIDE Full Throttle Kaburagi!</i>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
This is a work of fiction. All characters and organizations
 appearing in this work are fictional. In this work,
 characters sometimes engage in dangerous activities.
 While riding bicycles on actual roads,
 please follow all traffic laws and ride safely.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:51.000
<b><i>The high cadence
 continues!!</i></b>
